  "_about": "an osprey hunting over the water: long, narrow wings angled at the wrist like a gull's, dark brown above and white below, the dark carpal patches under the wing and the barred flight feathers; the white head with the dark eye stripe running back down the side of the neck, the short ragged crest, the brown band across the breast; the black hooked bill on its blue-grey cere, the yellow eye; the strong pale blue-grey feet. (rework/bigbirds/bigbirds.py)",
